        "subject": "LU-12187 lfs: keep the LFS_EC_OK check for 2.18",
        "message": "LU-12187 lfs: keep the LFS_EC_OK check for 2.18\n\nlfs setstripe has an #error that breaks the build once the version\npasses 2.17.90, as a reminder to drop the LFS_EC_OK acknowledgement\nfor erasure coding before 2.18. The removal will not land before 2.18,\nso the check has to ship in 2.18.0.\n\nMove the #error to 2.18.53, matching the other compatibility code\nthat is removed after 2.18.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I05006366c655aeac89024dd27b54e1e1a5eb9927\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/71029\nReviewed-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
